 "fieldData": {
  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Intake Form Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is an intake form?\", \"a\": \"An intake form is the set of questions a new client answers before work begins. It records what they need from you and the documents you need from them. In plain terms, the intake form meaning is the first record of a client relationship, kept for every later meeting.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I create an intake form?\", \"a\": \"List what you need before the first meeting, then mark the answers that should open extra questions. Describe both to Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder'>AI form builder</a>. It builds online intake forms with file uploads and a database table, and you change any question by prompting.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is an example of an intake form?\", \"a\": \"A personal trainer's first-session form is a common one. It asks about past injuries and the days the client can train, then ends with a waiver to sign. Among other intake form examples, a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder/massage-intake-form'>massage intake form</a> asks about pressure and areas to avoid before the session.\"}, {\"q\": \"Where can I find a free intake form?\", \"a\": \"Form galleries and professional associations publish free versions, often as PDFs to print. A free intake form template gives you questions to start with, but it does not route anyone or store answers. Emergent is free to start, and that tier covers building and publishing a working form.\"}, {\"q\": \"Why use online intake forms instead of paper?\", \"a\": \"Answers arrive typed, and nobody copies a clipboard into a spreadsheet after the visit. Online intake forms can also hide questions that do not apply and take a photo or a document on the same screen. Emergent puts no cap on responses, and a busy month never closes the form.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is another name for an intake form?\", \"a\": \"Client questionnaire is a common one. Some businesses call it a new client form, and events use a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder/registration-form'>registration form</a> for the same job. Whatever the label, a new client intake form collects the facts you need before you start.\"}, {\"q\": \"When should a client fill out an intake form?\", \"a\": \"At booking, or right after it, while you still have time to prepare. A client intake form that arrives the night before leaves no room to read the uploads. Set a reminder for anyone who has not finished it two days out.\"}, {\"q\": \"How long should a new client intake form be?\", \"a\": \"Short enough to finish on a phone in one sitting. Ask only what the first meeting will use, and let branching hide the sections that do not fit this client. Emergent builds the form from a prompt, which makes cutting a question you never use a one-sentence change.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can clients sign online intake forms?\", \"a\": \"Yes, when the form ends with the policy and a signature field under it. The client signs on the same phone they used for the questions. Anyone who accepts a cancellation policy or a photo release at intake arrives with nothing left to fill in at the front desk.\"}, {\"q\": \"What goes in a client intake form template?\", \"a\": \"Contact details, the service the client wants, their goals, and how they found you come first. Add an agreement with a signature at the end. A client intake form template for a specialty adds its own section: a therapy intake form, for example, asks what brings the client in.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
}